@startuml
title Partial Magnetic Architecture - Draft
component CurrentRamp
component ExcitingCoil
component IronCore
component AirGap
component FluxSensor
component MeasuringCoil

CurrentRamp --> ExcitingCoil : current phasor
ExcitingCoil --> IronCore : mmf / flux
IronCore --> AirGap : flux
AirGap --> FluxSensor : Phi
AirGap --> MeasuringCoil : induction

note right of IronCore
  Draft model does not expose:
  - leakage branch
  - element-wise core segmentation
  - electric ground
  - magnetic ground
  - revision/configuration values
end note
@enduml
